---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Report Abuse"
  description="How to report spam, fraudulent reseller listings, intellectual-property issues, or other abuse involving Davis Weather Station."
>
  <h2>1. What to report</h2>
  <p>Please contact us if you encounter:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Spam, scam, or fraudulent quote requests sent through the Site.</li>
    <li>A reseller listing that appears fake, outdated, or misleading.</li>
    <li>Harassment, threats, or unlawful content associated with the Site.</li>
    <li>Copyright or trademark infringement.</li>
    <li>Malicious links, malware, or phishing associated with a listing.</li>
    <li>Attempts to bypass security controls or abuse the quote form.</li>
    <li>Any other content or conduct that violates our <a href="/acceptable-use/">Acceptable Use Policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How to report</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:contact@davisweatherstation.com">contact@davisweatherstation.com</a> with the subject{' '}
    <strong>“Abuse report”</strong>. You may also use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Information to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name and contact email (so we can follow up).</li>
    <li>The URL or page where the issue appears.</li>
    <li>A description of the content or conduct and why you believe it is abusive.</li>
    <li>Screenshots or other evidence, if available.</li>
    <li>For intellectual-property reports, the information requested in our <a href="/intellectual-property/">Intellectual Property Notice</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Do not send passwords, payment-card data, or sensitive personal information. If you are reporting a security
    vulnerability, please follow the private process described in our security policy rather than posting it publicly.
  </p>

  <h2>4. What happens next</h2>
  <p>
    We review reports and may request additional information. Where appropriate, we may correct or remove a listing,
    block abusive users, preserve records, or notify the relevant service provider or authority. We do not guarantee a
    particular outcome and may not be able to share details of an investigation.
  </p>

  <h2>5. False or malicious reports</h2>
  <p>
    Please report in good faith. Knowingly false, harassing, or retaliatory reports may result in restrictions and may
    expose you to liability.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Emergencies and law enforcement</h2>
  <p>
    This reporting channel is not for emergencies. If someone is in danger, contact local emergency services. Law
    enforcement requests should be sent from an official address with appropriate legal process.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Abuse reports: <a href="mailto:contact@davisweatherstation.com">contact@davisweatherstation.com</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
